From: czyt <czytcn@gmail.com>
Subject: Disable account UI and hide official sync option

This patch:
- Disables VIP display in account settings
- Removes account entry from settings menu
- Removes SiYuan official sync option from sync provider dropdown
- Comments out account menu on mobile

